  /* ── lite: phones, tablets, narrow windows (html.is-lite, set before first paint and kept in sync by the script) ──
     url() SVG filters rasterise in software at full device resolution, blend modes and per-layer filters force extra
     full-screen surfaces, and every animated full-screen layer is its own ~12 MB texture at 3× (plus one more for whatever
